function r = westfall_young_adjust (resampled_p, sorted_p)
  % westfall_young_adjust  Westfall-Young single-step minP adjustment (Westfall & Young, 1993) -- a resampling- based FWER correction that accounts for the actual dependence structure between tests (unlike the analytic methods above, which either assume independence or make no assumption at all).
